{% extends 'pages/communities/sagamok/members-first-plan-layout.html.twig' %}
{% set plan_key = 'service' %}{% set plan_short = 'Public service' %}{% set plan_eyebrow = 'Priority 8' %}
{% set plan_title = 'A professional public service that members can rely on' %}
{% set plan_description = 'Clarify authority, strengthen fair hiring, retain skilled staff and publish service standards that survive changes in elected leadership.' %}
{% block plan_content %}
<section><header><p class="plan-kicker">The outcome</p><h2>Staff know their authority. Members know what service to expect.</h2><p class="plan-lede">Elected leadership sets direction and holds administration accountable. Administration runs services through documented roles, fair processes and professional standards.</p></header><div class="plan-grid plan-grid--3"><div class="plan-card"><h3>Clear authority</h3><p>Current organization chart, job accountabilities and delegated decisions.</p></div><div class="plan-card"><h3>Fair workforce systems</h3><p>Consistent hiring, acting appointments, pay, evaluation and development.</p></div><div class="plan-card"><h3>Reliable service</h3><p>Published access, response and completion standards by department.</p></div></div></section>
<section><header><p class="plan-kicker">Year One commitments</p><h2>Strengthen the operating core.</h2></header><div class="plan-commitments"><article class="plan-commitment"><h3>Current organization chart</h3><p>Publish departments, reporting lines, vacancies, acting roles and accountable executives.</p></article><article class="plan-commitment"><h3>Delegation register</h3><p>State which decisions belong to members, elected leadership, committees, executives and managers.</p></article><article class="plan-commitment"><h3>Workforce plan</h3><p>Identify critical roles, vacancies, succession risks, training needs and member career pathways.</p></article><article class="plan-commitment"><h3>Fair hiring audit</h3><p>Review competitions, acting appointments, conflict controls, documentation and candidate communication.</p></article><article class="plan-commitment"><h3>Department service charters</h3><p>Publish services, eligibility, response standards, escalation and quarterly performance.</p></article><article class="plan-commitment"><h3>Audit-action register</h3><p>Track every internal and external audit action to owner, deadline, evidence and closure.</p></article></div></section>
<section><header><p class="plan-kicker">Quarterly measures</p><h2>Measure capacity and service.</h2></header><div class="plan-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Workforce</th><th>Hiring</th><th>Service</th><th>Control</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Vacancy, turnover and acting-role duration</td><td>Competitions, time to fill and completed records</td><td>Requests received, answered and overdue</td><td>Audit actions open, overdue and closed</td></tr><tr><td>Training and succession milestones</td><td>Member applicants and development placements</td><td>Performance against each department standard</td><td>Policy reviews and delegated-authority exceptions</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="plan-decision"><h2>Decisions members make</h2><ul><li>Which service standards matter most?</li><li>What senior appointments require independent participation?</li><li>How should member hiring and merit work together?</li><li>Which administrative results belong in the public quarterly report?</li></ul></section>
<div class="plan-next"><a href="/communities/sagamok/members-first-plan/lands-safety-rights">← Lands, safety and rights</a><a href="/communities/sagamok/members-first-plan/implementation">Next: Implementation →</a></div>
{% endblock %}
